text @[Sanae]
text I want to continue teaching these children!
sound Q5B.aac
text @[Sanae]
text I want to continue being their teacher.
sound Q5C.aac
text @[Sanae]
text It may be an unshapely school...
sound Q5D.aac
text @[Sanae]
text ...and I may be a teacher who occasionally shows signs of being tired, but...
sound Q5E.aac
text @[Sanae]
text I want this, despite all that.
sound Q5F.aac
text @[Sanae]
text I want to be their teacher, despite all that.
sound Q5G.aac
text @[Sanae]
text That's what I want.
sound Q5H.aac
text @[Sanae]
text That's what's most important for me.
sound Q5I.aac
text @[Sanae]
text So, please...
sound Q5J.aac
text @[Sanae]
text Come back with me!
text She said it all.
