sound Q5S.aac
text @[Brats]
text Are you happy?!
sound Q5T.aac
text @[Brats]
text Sanae! Bombaye!
text Everyone cries out in delight in their own way, jumping up and down around Sanae-san.
text I wonder if there exists another adult out there that's loved this much by these kids.
text I bet there isn't, even if you searched through the entire town.
text And I'm not the only one who sensed that.
text I'm sure everyone who happens to be here thinks the same.
text That's why before long, the dumbfounded facial expressions of the parents turn into smiles...
text and they gather around Sanae-san and the kids...
text And before I know it, they make a circle, watching over them.
