text That night, we get a call from Sanae-san.
text After talking to Nagisa, she switches over to me.
text She thanks me for today, and everything else up until now.
text She says that because of us, she was able to summon up her courage.
text That because of us, she was finally able to take hold of it and speak up.
text Her voice sounds pleasant, and I just calmly listen to her, nodding to everything she says.
text Next to me, Nagisa looks at me peacefully.
text I feel for her hand.
text We then join hands, our fingers entwined.
text On the other end of the line, Sanae-san starts talking optimistically about the future.
text All the while considering her position in the Furukawa household...
text ...to be a happy one.
